sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Caller / host
  participant F as Markdown files
  participant M as codync-mem
  participant D as Caller-owned SQLite
  participant A as Agent / model
  C->>M: Load opening for bot and optional shared layer
  M->>D: Read recorded MEMORY.md versions
  M-->>C: Render memory context and note references
  C->>A: Start session with memory context
  A->>C: Request a topic note when needed
  C->>F: Read topic note
  F-->>C: Note content
  C-->>A: Return requested note
  Note over C,M: For a proposed memory change
  C->>M: Check content, caps and write permissions
  M->>D: Consult fact authorship and forgotten facts
  alt Change admitted
    C->>F: Apply approved content
    C->>M: Record version and reconcile facts
    M->>D: Write within caller's transaction
  else Change refused
    M-->>C: Refusal reason
  end
  Note over C,A: Between turns, caller may run a dream model.
  Note over C,M: dream audits proposals, caller applies accepted edits.
